		MESSAGE
		{
			title = World First Milestones
			message = The recent accomplishments of our space program have attracted contributions from numerous organizations!~n~nWe have broken a speed record of 25m/s.~n<color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1> 8,640 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have launched our first vessel.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  1,440 </color>~n~n We have broken a speed record of 80m/s.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken an altitude record of 500m.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken a speed record of 250m/s.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken a land distance record of 1,000m.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken an altitude record of 2,000m.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken a land distance record of 3,000m.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken an altitude record of 7,000m.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken a land distance record of 10km.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have splashed into the ocean.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  4,320 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n~n We have recovered our first crew from a mission.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  1,440 </color>~n~n We have performed the first one of our experiments at home.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  2,880 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n~n We have broken an altitude record of 22km.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken a speed record of 790m/s.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken a land distance record of 32km.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken an altitude record of 70km.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have reached space.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  14,400 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 3 </color>~n~n We have broken a land distance record of 100km.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,640 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have entered orbit.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  21,600 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 2 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 4 </color>~n~n We have returned to the surface from orbit.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  21,600 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 2 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 4 </color>~n~n We have returned to the surface.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  1,440 </color>~n~n We have performed an EVA test at home.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  2,880 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n~n We have performed a spacewalk in orbit of Kerbin.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,100 <color=#feb200>(-2,700)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have broken a speed record of 2,500m/s.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  6,480 <color=#feb200>(-2,160)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have initiated the first fly by of The Mun.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  17,550 <color=#feb200>(-5,850)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 2 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 4 </color>~n~n We have escaped the gravitational influence of Kerbin.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  17,820 <color=#feb200>(-5,940)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 2 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 5 </color>~n~n We have escaped the gravitational influence of The Mun.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  12,636 <color=#feb200>(-4,212)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 3 </color>~n~n We have initiated the first fly by of Kerbol.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  25,650 <color=#feb200>(-8,550)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 3 <color=#caff00>(+1)</color> </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 4 </color>~n~n We have entered orbit of Kerbol.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  24,624 <color=#feb200>(-8,208)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 3 <color=#caff00>(+1)</color> </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 3 </color>~n~n We have returned home from a fly by of The Mun.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  17,550 <color=#feb200>(-5,850)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 2 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 4 </color>~n~n We have gathered the first scientific data from The Mun.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  8,424 <color=#feb200>(-2,808)</color> </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n
			color = 3
			icon = 6
			read = False
		}
